Z||000005||88formula||05-22-2001||05:18 PM||||Splitfire spark plugs are a scam. If your motor is stock than get nothing else but AC Delco ignition parts. That includes wires, car, and rotor. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
